[center][color=#382c1f]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[/color][/center]

[size=5][b][color=#f59e0b]Compatibility[/color][/b][/size]

[color=#34d399][b]Compatible:[/b][/color]
[list]
[*]The vanilla follower system, Horde, NFF, AFT, EFF and custom follower frameworks
[*]Followers supported through a profile file, runtime registration or the older faction tags
[*]Followers without author support, added by you through New bond
[*]Custom-voiced followers and their own dialogue, scenes, reactions, quests and marriage systems
[*]Other romance and marriage mods; Romantasy keeps its own ledger and does not touch vanilla marriage
[*]SkyrimNet and OStim Standalone, both optional
[*]Existing saves; Romantasy can be added mid-playthrough
[*]Load order changes and followers whose mod is temporarily missing
[/list]

[color=#ef4444][b]Not compatible:[/b][/color]
[list]
[*]Saves made with 4.0.0 loaded in Romantasy 3.0.1 or older (bond points would be lost)
[*]Skyrim VR (the ledger is not supported there)
[*]Followers created at runtime by other mods without a stable plugin record (they cannot be given a bond)
[/list]


[center][color=#382c1f]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[/color][/center]

[size=5][b][color=#f59e0b]Troubleshooting[/color][/b][/size]

[color=#fbbf24][b]The ledger does not open[/b][/color]
Make sure Magelight UI 1.6 or newer is installed; without it the game shows a one-line HUD message and points are still tracked. Check that SKSE64 and Address Library match your exact Skyrim runtime. If Open with Favorites Menu is on, Left Ctrl + R is off: cast the Romantasy power instead. Once the ledger opens, the Health section in Settings names anything else that is wrong.

[color=#fbbf24][b]A follower does not appear in the ledger[/b][/color]
If she has official Romantasy support, make sure that support is installed and enabled. Otherwise bring her along, open the ledger and use New bond. If the roster is empty but you know you have bonds, they may all be away: turn on Show away companions. Followers generated at runtime by other mods cannot be added.

[color=#fbbf24][b]My points did not change after I did something[/b][/color]
She may not care about that deed, or she may not have been actively following you when the game recorded it. Turn on Detailed log in Settings and look in [font=Courier New]Romantasy.log[/font]: every deed writes a [font=Courier New]why:[/font] line that says what changed, or why nothing did. On Slow burn, a days-together gate can also hold a gain at the top of the current tier.

[color=#fbbf24][b]The tier popup came late[/b][/color]
That is the calm moment at work. By default a tier popup waits until you are out of combat and somewhere peaceful, for up to one in-game day; the points and the tier in the ledger change at once. Set Tier changes arrive to At once for the old timing. With OStim, popups also wait while a scene plays.

[color=#fbbf24][b]I see no whispers[/b][/color]
Check Whispers is on in Settings. Whispers wait while a menu, dialogue or loading screen is up and are dropped after 30 seconds. If Magelight cannot give Romantasy its second view, whispers fall back to the game's own notifications and the Health section says so.

[color=#fbbf24][b]A bond vanished when I removed a follower mod[/b][/color]
From the first save made with 4.0.0, the bond is kept and returns with the mod. A bond that an older version already dropped cannot be recovered.

[color=#fbbf24][b]Recent changes looks empty but the total changed[/b][/color]
Recent changes belongs to the follower whose dossier is selected, and keeps her last five changes. Open her Journal for the longer story.

[color=#fbbf24][b]Does this marry my follower in the vanilla system?[/b][/color]
No. Spouse is Romantasy's own bond level. A follower mod can use it as the trigger for a marriage scene, but Romantasy never performs or replaces vanilla marriage.

[color=#fbbf24][b]Will this slow my game down?[/b][/color]
No polling. The tracker is native SKSE code that reacts to the game's statistic events, and the ledger only draws while it is open.


